ssue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: Godot v4.4.dev5\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.dev5 - Windows 10.0.19045 - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Mobile) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6094) - AMD Ryzen 7 3800X 8-Core Processor (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen parsing very large or very small ints via JSON, an incorrect result is returned, even with full_precision = true.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n```gdscript\nvar large_int: int = 9223372036854775807 # Fails with many very large / very small int values.\nprint(large_int) # 9223372036854775807\nvar json : String = JSON.stringify(large_int, \"\", true, true)\nprint(json) # 9223372036854775807\nvar parsed_int : int = JSON.parse_string(json)\nprint(parsed_int) # -9223372036854775808\nvar alt_int_parse : int = int(json)\nprint(alt_int_parse) # 9223372036854775807\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[json.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18719379/json.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/A